# --- Python & Environments ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# --- Python tooling ---
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/*.egg-info/

# --- Jupyter Notebooks ---
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Data & Logs ---
**/*.csv
**/*.jsonl
**/*.log

# --- Security & Secrets ---
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# --- IDE / OS ---
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store

